    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dadkii Yuruusaalem Degganaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaasaa reer binu Israa'iil oo dhan loogu abtiriyey, oo bal eeg, iyagu waxay ku qoran yihiin kitaabkii boqorrada reer binu Israa'iil. Oo dadkii Yahuudahna xadgudubkoodii aawadiis ayaa maxaabiis ahaan loogu kaxaystay Baabuloon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba kuwii ugu horreeyey oo degay dalkii ay hantiyeen iyo magaalooyinkoodii waxay ahaayeen reer binu Israa'iil, wadaaddadii, iyo kuwii reer Laawi, iyo reer Netiiniim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yeruusaalem waxaa ka degganaa reer Yahuudah, iyo reer Benyaamiin, iyo reer Efrayim, iyo reer Manaseh: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuutay oo ahaa ina Cammiihuud, ina Coomrii, ina Imrii, ina Baanii oo ahaa reer Feres oo ahaa wiilkii Yahuudah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo reer Shiilohna waxaa ka degganaa Casaayaah oo ahaa curadkii iyo wiilashiisii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reer Seraxna waxaa ka joogay Yecuu'eel iyo walaalahood, oo waxay ahaayeen lix boqol iyo sagaashan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo reer Benyaamiinna waxaa ka joogay Sallu oo ahaa ina Meshullaam, ina Hoodawyaah, ina Hasenu'aah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Yibneyaah oo ahaa ina Yeroxaam, iyo Eelaah oo ahaa ina Cusii, ina Mikrii, iyo Meshullaam oo ahaa ina Shefatyaah, ina Recuu'eel, ina Yibniyaah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo walaalahood oo ahaa sidii dhalashadoodu ahayd, oo waxayna ahaayeen sagaal boqol iyo lix iyo konton. Oo nimankaas oo dhammu waxay ahaayeen madaxdii reerahooda siday kala reer u ahaayeen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wadaaddadiina waxaa ka joogay Yedacyaah, iyo Yehooyaariib, iyo Yaakiin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Casaryaah oo ahaa ina Xilqiyaah, ina Meshullaam, ina Saadooq, ina Meraayood, ina Axiituub oo ahaa taliyihii guriga Ilaah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Cadaayaah oo ahaa ina Yeroxaam, ina Fashxuur, ina Malkiiyaah, iyo Macsay oo ahaa ina Cadii'eel, ina Yaxseraah, ina Meshullaam, ina Meshilleemiid, ina Immeer, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo walaalahood oo ahaa madaxdii reerahooda, oo tiradooduna ahayd kun iyo toddoba boqol iyo lixdan, oo waxayna ahaayeen rag aad karti ugu leh shuqulka adeegidda guriga Ilaah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo reer Laawina waxaa ka joogay Shemacyaah oo ahaa ina Xashuub, ina Casriiqaam, ina Xashabyaah oo ahaa reer Meraarii, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Baqbaqar, iyo Xeresh, iyo Gaalaal, iyo Matanyaah oo ahaa ina Miikaa, ina Sikrii, ina Aasaaf, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Cobadyaah oo ahaa ina Shemacyaah, ina Gaalaal, ina Yeduutuun, iyo Berekyaah oo ahaa ina Aasaa, ina Elqaanaah, kaasoo degganaan jiray tuulooyinkii reer Netofaah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo iridjoogayaashiina waxaa ka joogay Shalluum, iyo Caquub, iyo Talmon, iyo Axiiman, iyo walaalahood, oo waxaa iyaga madax u ahaa Shalluum, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo ilaa maantadan la joogo boqorka iriddiisa xaggeeda bari joogi jiray, oo iyagu waxay iridjoogayaal u ahaayeen xeradii reer Laawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Shalluum ina Qore oo ahaa ina Ebiyaasaaf, ina Qorax, iyo walaalihiis oo ahaa reer Qorax, waxay u talin jireen shuqulkii adeegidda, oo waxay ahaayeen waardiyayaashii irdaha taambuugga, oo awowayaashoodna waxay u talin jireen xeradii Rabbiga, oo waxay ahaayeen waardiyayaashii iridda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waagii hore waxaa iyaga madax u ahaan jiray Fiinexaas oo ahaa ina Elecaasaar, oo Rabbiguna isaga wuu la jiri jiray. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Sekaryaah ina Meshelemyaahna wuxuu ahaan jiray iridjoogihii iridda teendhadii shirka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kulligood intaas loo doortay inay iridjoogayaal ahaadaan waxay dhammaantood ahaayeen laba boqol iyo laba iyo toban. Oo kuwaas abtiriskooda waxaa lagu tiriyey tuulooyinkoodii, kuwaasoo Daa'uud iyo Samuu'eel oo ahaa waxarkihii ay u doorteen shuqulkoodii lagu aaminay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba iyaga iyo carruurtooduba waxay u sarrayn jireen irdaha guriga Rabbiga, kaasoo ahaa gurigii taambuugga iyagoo waardiyayaal ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo afarta dhinacba waxaa joogay iridjoogayaashii xagga bari, iyo xagga galbeed, iyo xagga woqooyi, iyo xagga koonfureedba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo walaalahoodii tuulooyinkooda joogayna had iyo goor toddobadii maalmoodba way u iman jireen inay iyaga la joogaan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waayo, afarta iridjooge oo sare oo ahaa reer Laawi waxay ku jireen jagooyin joogto ah, oo waxay u talin jireen qolalka, iyo khasnadihii guriga Ilaah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo iyagu waxay u hoyan jireen guriga Ilaah hareerihiisa, maxaa yeelay, ilaalinta gurigu iyagay saarnayd, oo waxaa iyaga joogto u ahaa inay subax kasta furaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo iyaga qaarkoodna waxay u talin jireen weelasha lagu adeego, waayo, weelasha tiraa lagu soo gelin jiray, oo tiraa lagu bixin jiray. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo iyaga qaarkood kalena waxaa loo doortay inay u taliyaan alaabta guriga iyo weelasha meesha quduuska ah oo dhan, iyo burka, iyo khamriga, iyo saliidda, iyo fooxa, iyo uunsiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wiilashii wadaaddada qaarkoodna waxay hagaajin jireen cadarkii uunsiga lahaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Matityaah oo ka mid ahaa reer Laawi, oo ahaa curadkii Shalluum oo ahaa reer Qorax shuqulkiisii joogtada ahaa wuxuu ahaa inuu ilaaliyo waxyaalaha digsiyada lagu dubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
