              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Gibecoonna waxaa degganaa Gibecoon aabbihiis oo la odhan jiray Yecii'eel, oo naagtiisa magaceedana waxaa la odhan jiray Macakaah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
